00:47:43.680 --> 00:47:44.140
in on it.

1091
00:47:44.300 --> 00:47:46.080
Now, listen, he still would have been bummed.

1092
00:47:46.240 --> 00:47:50.840
He still would have spent a ton of energy trying to make everyone like somehow find

1093
00:47:50.840 --> 00:47:53.380
a way to be okay celebrating his birthday.

1094
00:47:53.660 --> 00:47:53.980
Yeah.

1095
00:47:54.240 --> 00:47:55.420
Which he's going to do later.

1096
00:47:55.700 --> 00:47:55.960
Okay.

