00:48:30.480 --> 00:48:36.300
giant puffy coat that you're going to see her wearing later at the ice rink is hanging

1106
00:48:36.300 --> 00:48:40.380
up and Jim's big, heavy winter coat are on the coat rack.

1107
00:48:40.800 --> 00:48:42.560
I see what's happening here.

