00:48:58.220 --> 00:48:58.800
What's up?

1112
00:48:58.860 --> 00:49:00.440
Is it cold out or not cold out?

1113
00:49:00.480 --> 00:49:01.100
It's cold out.

1114
00:49:01.260 --> 00:49:01.640
Which one?

1115
00:49:02.420 --> 00:49:04.080
Someone's slipping on the job there.

1116
00:49:04.300 --> 00:49:05.300
I don't know.

1117
00:49:05.560 --> 00:49:06.340
I don't know.

1118
00:49:06.420 --> 00:49:07.400
I'm just saying.

1119
00:49:07.720 --> 00:49:08.020
Okay.

1120
00:49:08.240 --> 00:49:11.900
Well, I have a big thing to point out, everyone.

