What does Pam do?

1130
00:49:35.460 --> 00:49:35.860
I know.

1131
00:49:36.000 --> 00:49:37.740
What does she do, Jenna?

1132
00:49:38.340 --> 00:49:40.160
She, I know, Angela.

1133
00:49:40.500 --> 00:49:45.280
She says, Luke, this is your father.

1134
00:49:45.280 --> 00:49:47.180
Uh, Star Wars!

1135
00:49:47.460 --> 00:49:47.940
Star Wars.

1136
00:49:47.940 --> 00:49:49.720
She makes a Star Wars reference.

1137
00:49:50.080 --> 00:49:52.680
Jenna, did you know what you were doing when you did it?

1138
00:49:53.320 --> 00:50:04.480
I did because I knew from just, you know, pop culture knowledge that there was a movie

1139
00:50:04.480 --> 00:50:06.220
from the Star Wars movies.

