00:50:06.420 --> 00:50:08.500
Is it Empire Strikes Back?

1141
00:50:09.320 --> 00:50:09.880
That...

1142
00:50:09.880 --> 00:50:11.620
Yes, where they're fighting each other.

1143
00:50:11.820 --> 00:50:12.340
Yes.

1144
00:50:12.480 --> 00:50:16.280
And it is revealed that Darth Vader is Luke Skywalker's father.

1145
00:50:16.280 --> 00:50:17.800
He says, I am your father.

1146
00:50:17.960 --> 00:50:20.040
And Luke's like, no, that's not true.

1147
00:50:20.040 --> 00:50:27.680
I knew the reference, but I did get a fan question from kslackish1 who wanted to know if that bit

1148
00:50:27.680 --> 00:50:30.780
where I make the announcement was improvised.

1149
00:50:30.920 --> 00:50:33.380
So the Luke line was scripted.

1150
00:50:33.500 --> 00:50:36.300
However, I did improvise a little bit.

1151
00:50:36.300 --> 00:50:41.540
So when I say I'm sorry into the mic, that was my fun idea.

1152
00:50:41.540 --> 00:50:45.540
And it was a little nod to the movie When Harry Met Sally.

1153
00:50:46.500 --> 00:50:51.660
So do you remember the scene in When Harry Met Sally when Harry and Sally, they're singing

1154
00:50:51.660 --> 00:50:53.100
karaoke in the store.

1155
00:50:53.300 --> 00:50:55.240
They're singing Surrey with a Fringe on Top.

1156
00:50:55.620 --> 00:51:00.500
And Harry's ex-wife starts to walk up and he stops singing.

1157
00:51:00.800 --> 00:51:04.780
And Meg Ryan is like, oh my gosh, it's my voice.

1158
00:51:04.780 --> 00:51:05.720
I have the worst voice.

1159
00:51:05.720 --> 00:51:07.400
And she's saying it all in the microphone.

1160
00:51:07.580 --> 00:51:12.000
And Harry is like, no, I think I see Helen.

1161
00:51:12.280 --> 00:51:15.540
And then really loudly into the microphone, Meg Ryan goes, Helen?

1162
00:51:16.520 --> 00:51:18.600
And it like goes out over the store.

1163
00:51:18.780 --> 00:51:21.400
I always thought that was such a funny bit.

1164
00:51:21.400 --> 00:51:25.700
So I thought I'm going to say I'm sorry into the mic really loudly.

1165
00:51:26.740 --> 00:51:28.000
And I don't know.

1166
00:51:28.440 --> 00:51:32.980
I mean, probably no one would ever think about it.

1167
00:51:33.160 --> 00:51:35.580
But your inspiration for that moment?

1168
00:51:35.580 --> 00:51:36.460
I love that.

1169
00:51:36.580 --> 00:51:37.460
I think that's so sweet.

1170
00:51:37.580 --> 00:51:40.640
I also know how much you love When Harry Met Sally.

1171
00:51:40.780 --> 00:51:42.020
It's one of your favorite movies.

1172
00:51:42.540 --> 00:51:48.320
Lady, when I was in college, I had a three and a half hour drive between St.

1173
00:51:48.460 --> 00:51:52.580
Louis, which is where my parents still lived, and Kirksville, Missouri, which is a little

1174
