1175
00:51:58.500 --> 00:52:05.800
And what I did to pass the time was I recorded When Harry Met Sally onto an audio tape.

1176
00:52:06.420 --> 00:52:12.800
And then I played the movie back for myself in my car on my drive.

1177
00:52:12.800 --> 00:52:16.900
I have that entire movie memorized from beginning to end.

1178
00:52:17.140 --> 00:52:18.520
I love it.

1179
00:52:18.740 --> 00:52:18.880
I love that.

1180
00:52:19.120 --> 00:52:20.780
That is the sweetest thing.

1181
00:52:21.140 --> 00:52:21.460
Yeah.

1182
00:52:21.640 --> 00:52:26.780
I recorded on my tape recorder David Letterman's opening monologues.

1183
00:52:27.040 --> 00:52:30.800
And I would play them back and listen to his opening monologues.

1184
00:52:31.080 --> 00:52:32.420
Oh, my gosh.

1185
00:52:32.860 --> 00:52:37.040
Well, you said you wanted to work for a late night talk show.

1186
00:52:37.040 --> 00:52:38.420
I wanted to work in comedy.

1187
00:52:38.640 --> 00:52:40.960
You love, yeah, comedy late night.

1188
00:52:41.300 --> 00:52:41.460
Yeah.

1189
00:52:41.860 --> 00:52:42.080
Yeah.

1190
00:52:42.780 --> 00:52:43.680
Aw, lady.

1191
