Look, we were meant to be BFFs.

1192
00:52:45.720 --> 00:52:47.420
We were both driving in our cars.

1193
00:52:47.840 --> 00:52:48.180
We were.

1194
00:52:48.320 --> 00:52:54.900
Listening to things we recorded off of our TVs because we're 100 on our tape decks.

1195
00:52:55.420 --> 00:52:57.440
Lady, I just got a text from Lee.

1196
00:52:57.680 --> 00:52:58.820
He sent me a photo of it.

1197
00:52:58.820 --> 00:52:59.780
Is this about your bread?

1198
