He made sandwiches for the kids.

1202
00:53:04.560 --> 00:53:05.780
I want to see if they like it.

1203
00:53:05.780 --> 00:53:06.660
Oh, my God.

1204
00:53:06.660 --> 00:53:07.300
He did it.

1205
00:53:07.420 --> 00:53:08.040
Way to go, Lee.

1206
00:53:08.420 --> 00:53:09.480
