1207
00:53:09.600 --> 00:53:10.480
That's the question.

1208
00:53:10.480 --> 00:53:11.360
We'll find out.

1209
00:53:11.660 --> 00:53:11.900
All right.

1210
00:53:11.960 --> 00:53:12.720
We'll be right back.

1211
00:53:23.310 --> 00:53:25.790
Bread report for everyone who's curious.

1212
00:53:26.550 --> 00:53:27.770
It's freaking delicious.

1213
00:53:27.770 --> 00:53:28.850
I just ate a slice.

1214
00:53:29.090 --> 00:53:29.670
Is it?

1215
00:53:29.870 --> 00:53:30.350
It's good.

1216
00:53:30.350 --> 00:53:31.930
I don't know if the kids are going to eat it.

1217
00:53:32.010 --> 00:53:32.930
What is their deal?

1218
00:53:33.230 --> 00:53:34.050
You know what, Angela?

1219
00:53:34.330 --> 00:53:36.530
They love all of my other breads.

1220
00:53:36.650 --> 00:53:37.870
They love my sourdough bread.

1221
00:53:37.870 --> 00:53:39.090
They love when I make rolls.

1222
00:53:39.370 --> 00:53:40.610
They love when I make popovers.

1223
