For whatever reason, I cannot get them to like my sandwich bread.

1224
00:53:45.570 --> 00:53:47.870
They just want store-bought sandwich bread.

1225
00:53:48.050 --> 00:53:49.650
I've tried three different recipes.

1226
00:53:49.850 --> 00:53:52.350
Today will have been my third sandwich bread recipe.

1227
00:53:52.730 --> 00:53:53.650
I don't know.

1228
00:53:53.770 --> 00:53:59.030
Or they will like it the day it comes out of the oven, but the next day, it's a no-go for them.

1229
00:53:59.170 --> 00:54:01.310
They only want it warm out of the oven.

1230
00:54:01.450 --> 00:54:02.090
I don't know.

1231
00:54:02.390 --> 00:54:05.010
Shall we get back into this episode, my lady?

1232
00:54:05.310 --> 00:54:06.750
I think we should.

1233
00:54:06.750 --> 00:54:07.850
Where are we?

1234
00:54:08.850 --> 00:54:17.710
I believe that we are back in human resources, 15 minutes, 15 seconds.

