1280
00:56:22.730 --> 00:56:23.570
Her knee was okay.

1281
00:56:23.570 --> 00:56:27.590
I thought it was interesting when you saw the different couplings of people ice skating.

1282
00:56:27.750 --> 00:56:29.210
In the beginning, you see Kelly and Ryan.

1283
00:56:29.490 --> 00:56:31.510
You see Pam and Jim.

1284
00:56:32.010 --> 00:56:34.250
I sort of just kind of go around solo.

1285
00:56:34.350 --> 00:56:35.130
So does Dwight.

1286
00:56:35.350 --> 00:56:38.370
We just kind of, we don't, you know, want anyone to know we're seeing each other.

1287
00:56:38.450 --> 00:56:39.470
So we skate alone.

1288
00:56:39.750 --> 00:56:45.510
And then later you see Ryan and Phyllis holding hands and ice skating.

1289
00:56:45.770 --> 00:56:47.570
Yes, at 19 minutes.

1290
00:56:48.250 --> 00:56:51.530
We had a fan catch by KP who said,

1291
00:56:51.530 --> 00:56:55.890
I love when you see Ryan and Phyllis at the skating rink holding hands so Ryan won't fall.

1292
00:56:56.230 --> 00:56:58.470
It's such a random glimpse into their friendship.

1293
00:56:58.670 --> 00:57:01.910
I think, Angela, they did that because Mindy was icing her knee.

1294
00:57:02.090 --> 00:57:05.350
And what's really cute if you watch it is Phyllis is so tickled.

1295
00:57:05.530 --> 00:57:06.650
She's so tickled.

1296
00:57:06.710 --> 00:57:07.890
It's just really cute.

1297
00:57:08.090 --> 00:57:09.310
It's very, very sweet.

1298
00:57:09.390 --> 00:57:13.050
And I actually, I went back after I read that comment and I watched it.

1299
00:57:13.130 --> 00:57:16.450
And it's really very sweet to see the two of them skating together.

1300
00:57:16.510 --> 00:57:18.550
So that was an accident.

