1304
00:57:27.970 --> 00:57:29.610
So here's something interesting.

1305
00:57:29.890 --> 00:57:33.410
In this episode, Jim is kind of helping Pam on the ice.

1306
00:57:33.910 --> 00:57:37.150
But right before we filmed this episode,

1307
00:57:37.150 --> 00:57:40.630
I had actually been in some intense ice skating training

1308
00:57:40.630 --> 00:57:44.110
because I was filming a movie with Will Ferrell called Blades of Glory.

1309
00:57:45.350 --> 00:57:48.890
And yeah, every Saturday morning for a few months,

1310
00:57:48.890 --> 00:57:52.490
I had to go early in the morning and spend about three hours learning to ice skate.

1311
00:57:52.630 --> 00:57:56.690
And the crazy thing is my character didn't even ice skate in the movie.

1312
00:57:56.930 --> 00:58:02.550
I am completely pretending to not know how to ice skate in this scene on The Office

1313
00:58:02.550 --> 00:58:07.570
because I had actually just, I mean, kind of learned how to ice skate quite well

1314
00:58:07.570 --> 00:58:09.070
thanks to this movie training.

1315
00:58:09.070 --> 00:58:10.930
You're describing my fantasy.

1316
00:58:10.930 --> 00:58:14.110
But all I ever wanted was to be cast in something where they're like,

1317
00:58:14.250 --> 00:58:17.790
