1318
00:58:18.290 --> 00:58:20.230
You're going to go every Saturday.

1319
00:58:20.790 --> 00:58:22.710
You're going to become a kung fu master.

1320
00:58:23.330 --> 00:58:25.910
Or you're going to have to learn how to throw an axe.

1321
00:58:26.150 --> 00:58:28.390
You're going to get really good at throwing axes.

1322
00:58:28.830 --> 00:58:31.450
Like, I wanted to learn something like that.

1323
00:58:31.750 --> 00:58:33.750
But it's never happened.

1324
00:58:33.750 --> 00:58:39.470
Well, speaking of skating, Michael is zipping around in his hockey gear.

1325
00:58:39.530 --> 00:58:44.270
So in the background of Michael's talking head, it's around 17 minutes, 42 seconds.

1326
00:58:44.410 --> 00:58:48.630
There's a really great shot of that professional ice skater, Burt Lankin,

1327
00:58:48.770 --> 00:58:50.110
