And if you watch closely, Steve's body never really touches Toby.

1342
00:59:27.430 --> 00:59:32.410
Like, he really—like, Steve, I think because he's so good,

1343
00:59:33.170 --> 00:59:36.990
he kind of slams into the wall and makes a noise with his arMs.

1344
00:59:37.110 --> 00:59:40.070
And then Paul just sort of falls to the ground himself.

1345
00:59:40.350 --> 00:59:42.050
No, Steve had total control.

1346
00:59:42.070 --> 00:59:44.030
But it's because he's such a good skater.

1347
00:59:44.070 --> 00:59:48.250
