Oh, this was for sure one of Steve's favorite film days, I think.

1349
00:59:52.710 --> 00:59:53.370
It had to be.

1350
00:59:53.490 --> 00:59:54.250
It had to be.

1351
00:59:54.490 --> 00:59:54.730
Yeah.

1352
00:59:54.850 --> 00:59:56.150
He was having the best time.

1353
