But Michael's so innocent.

1357
01:00:11.190 --> 01:00:13.530
He's like, oh, was this for sale?

1358
01:00:13.730 --> 01:00:14.970
And she's like, no, Michael.

1359
01:00:15.730 --> 01:00:19.990
I can go places that aren't for sale, you know?

1360
01:00:20.150 --> 01:00:22.390
Like, my kids are here to ice skate.

1361
01:00:22.590 --> 01:00:24.850
And then he's so sweet with the kids.

1362
01:00:24.850 --> 01:00:25.750
He's so sweet.

1363
01:00:25.750 --> 01:00:30.710
And we sort of learned that, like, Michael probably could have tried to play professional

1364
