It's coming as a surprise to you, too.

1422
01:02:56.790 --> 01:02:56.970
Yeah.

1423
01:02:57.090 --> 01:02:57.570
I know.

1424
01:02:57.750 --> 01:02:58.770
I'm going to fill you in.

1425
01:02:59.030 --> 01:02:59.250
Yeah.

1426
01:03:00.070 --> 01:03:00.550
Yes.

